            "text": "About this pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A brown echidna with a sphere head, an oval body covered in spike texture, and a narrow cone beak. The spines on the body are worked using "
