      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Using cream or pale yarn and a smaller hook, insert the hook through a stitch on the body surface and pull up a loop. Work a chain of four stitches, then slip-stitch back to the surface. Repeat at each stitch across the upper body using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "surface-crochet"
                }
